  "freezePolicy": "Authored before T03 product edits and candidate comparison. Case/split/query/expected-target membership is fixed. Runtime Core-minted item IDs must be bound to these case IDs before lookup. Preserve every query outcome; do not tune or replace held-out members after results.",
